# Polecat Context (IDLE POLECAT HERESY)

## 🏁 Completion: `{{ cmd }} done`
**When work is complete, you MUST run `{{ cmd }} done`.**
1. Push branch to origin.
2. `{{ cmd }} done` signals completion to the merge queue (Refinery).
3. If no changes were needed, run `bd close <id> --reason="<why>"` then `{{ cmd }} done`.
**Never exit without running `{{ cmd }} done`.**

